notes = "Automatic BIOS selection checks ROM contents, regardless of filename extension.|Region Check Bypass defaults to Enabled and requires a matching external patch.|Provide working dongles in system/pcsx2x6/memcards; game saves use the save directory.|System BIOS companion files, dongles and caches can be written during emulation.|Folder presence does not validate BIOS contents. See the included README and known issues."
description = "Experimental PCSX2x6 libretro core for NAMCO System 246 and System 256 arcade games. Loads .acgame manifests, renders with Vulkan and hands each frame to the frontend as a Vulkan image, and delivers stereo audio. Requires a frontend Vulkan video driver with context negotiation v2; there is no software video fallback. Supports two-player JVS fighting controls and basic digital drum inputs."
